# FORLORN HOPE: the map is sound and at full scale: one base and one
# waystone pad, four plates, four thorn hearts, eight keys, five doors,
# every one of the seventeen kinds of foe (oozles, midges and hornets come
# out of the drains, combs and bells on the map), and the art loads.
game forlorn
cheat start 1
wait 5
expect map_bad == 0
expect kinds == 17
expect hearts == 4
expect keys_total == 8
expect doors_total == 5
expect drains >= 8
expect combs >= 2
expect foes >= 40
expect art_ok == 1
expect bot_plans == 28
# 160 x 80 tiles: the bottom right corner is rock, the map's edges are walls
expect solid79159 == 1
expect solid40000 == 1
